            "text": "The `data` and integer conversion branches are swapped, as suspected. The documented SysEx format uses parentheses (`data=(10,20,30)`), while your example uses bare comma-separated values. I’ll reproduce both forms and an ordinary integer-valued message to check the full impact.\n"
